      "block_id": "2605.06070_p3_b0",
      "text": "captions [5]. Advances in diffusion formulations and training objectives, such as improved parameter-\nizations [31, 13] and flow-based variants [20, 21], further enhance performance. Despite this, these\npre-trained models typically require post-training to perform alignment optimization for real-world\napplications [35].\n",
      "bbox": [
        108.0,
        74.41,
        505.66,
        117.1
      ],
      "rendered_bbox": [
